        "source_text": "AI/ML Engineer June 2024 – Present\nAvataa Solutions Pvt. Ltd. Hyderabad, India\n– Developed AI-powered applications using Python, FastAPI, NLP, LLMs (OpenAI,Gemini), and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).\n– Built scalable REST APIs for AI-based document processing and intelligent automation.\n– Integrated OpenAI and Gemini APIs for document summarization and AI workflows using prompt engineering.\n– Worked on OCR, NER, embeddings, and data preprocessing for document analysis.\n– Developed backend services using FastAPI and PostgreSQL for real-time event-driven processing.\n– Collaborated with cross-functional teams to build and deploy production-ready AI solutions.",
